core/newvoice-core/src/reference_norms.rs is generated from the same statistics.

harness/corpus/librispeech/ contains 20 unmodified utterances from
LibriSpeech dev-clean, used as validation test data only (not shipped):
  Panayotov, V., Chen, G., Povey, D., & Khudanpur, S. (2015). LibriSpeech:
  an ASR corpus based on public domain audio books. ICASSP 2015.
  Licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/);
  source https://www.openslr.org/12/.

